-- KELMET CLASS AW STRUCT -------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K0920

`class` w `struct` w `record` w `interface` men loghat tanya. Kalam bey3arraf el record b `haykal` wel interface b `sefa`.

1│ class Point:
   ^^^^^

Garrab: `haykal`

Mosa3da: Ekteb `haykal Esm:` w `field: Type` f kol satr maza7, aw `sefa Esm:` lel interface. `kalam fix` beyghayar el kelma.

